Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:47:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat(calls): editable dialer number field with paste +
 format cleaning

- Add a TextBox above the dialer avatar so numbers can be typed or pasted
- PhoneNumberUtils.CleanDialInput strips spaces, dashes, dots, brackets and
  a trunk '(0)', keeping digits, '*', '#' and a leading '+'
  e.g. '+420 (739) 017 476' -> '+420739017476'
- Clean numbers before dialing and when submitted from contact search
- Window-level dial shortcuts ignore keys typed into text boxes;
  Enter in the number field dials

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
